/-- **THE T = 15 TOP-EDGE SIGN THEOREM** -- unconditional, no numeric
hypotheses, no residual conjecture:

    Re xi(sigma + 15i) < -1/10000   for every sigma in [1/2, 1].

Proved by exhaustive case split over 18 certified boxes.
Each branch is that box's own kernel-green capstone. -/
theorem top15_re_lt_neg_1e4 {σ : ℝ}
